        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Effective June 23, 2002 Full-Time employees who have relieved a Department Head prior to June 23, 2002 shall receive a minimum rate of $865.00 per week. Full-Time employees who have never relieved a Department Head, the minimum rate shall be $825.00 per week. Any Full-Time employee who relieves that makes at or above these rates shall receive a premium of $10.00 per week for such relief.",
